### Controlled example

You can also use a controlled checkbox component driven by state:

```jsx
function ExampleComponent() {
  const [isChecked, setIsChecked] = useState(false);
  return (
    <Checkbox
      id="checkbox"
      labelText="checkbox"
      checked={isChecked}
      onChange={(_, { checked }) => setIsChecked(checked)}
    />
  );
}
```

